  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Экспозиция\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Мод для пленочной фотографии</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\" alt=\"Камера\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\" alt=\"Пленка\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\" alt=\"Процесс проявки\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\" alt=\"Печать\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\" alt=\"Фотография\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br></div><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\" alt=\"Дополнительные функции\" width=\"260\"></p><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\" alt=\"Хроматический\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\" alt=\"Межпланетный проектор\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-polaroid\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\" alt=\"Поляроид\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-catalog\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\" alt=\"Каталог\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\" alt=\"Негативы\" width=\"1000\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" width=\"1000\" height=\"380\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252fexposure%252flatest%252fdocs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/wiki.png\" alt=\"Вики\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Известные несовместимости:</strong></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Optifine</strong> — известен тем, что вызывает проблемы с другими модами. Вместо него используйте Sodium/Embeddium.</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Visual Overhaul</strong> — крашится при открытии управления камерой — <a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issue</a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Exordium</strong> — вызывает проблемы и мерцание при просмотре через видоискатель.</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>FastAnim</strong> (Fabric) — нарушает анимации модели игрока при использовании камеры. <a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71\" rel=\"nofollow\">Проблема на GitHub</a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Нравится мод? Ваша поддержка позволит мне продолжать работу над этим и другими модами!</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"558.73\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"191.75\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" alt=\"Золотая камера\" width=\"1000\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Сервер Discord\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Посмотрите мои другие моды:</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
